{"h":3406,"lines":[{"y":0.04780096100918263,"w":0.064051411946614567,"t":"Test 1","h":0.013409705842444275,"c":1,"x":0.063850582583629856},{"y":0.16133720917273231,"t":"E","x":0.063917525973246986,"h":0.014534883616744709,"w":0.016494844754536955,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"F","w":0.014432989756266279,"y":0.30232558122122133,"x":0.06185566998440982,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"w":0.020618556340535478,"t":"G","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.059793814530763191,"y":0.40406976734860434},{"y":0.5450581393607562,"t":"H","x":0.059793814191410548,"w":0.018556701342264816,"c":1,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"t":"leaves in winter, thus enabling radiation to be reflected by the snow. Re-routing Russian rivers","c":1,"x":0.10927835681646021,"h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.095930232278511274,"w":0.82886596679687496},{"x":0.11134019375376454,"w":0.82680414835611971,"y":0.11479741608637528,"h":0.017615971814445186,"c":1,"t":"to increase cold water flow to ice-forming areas could also be used to slow down warming, say"},{"t":"some climate scientists.","y":0.13358778641645852,"c":1,"x":0.11134020975453804,"w":0.20824741363525393,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"But will such schemes ever be implemented? Generally speaking, those who are most cautious","h":0.020274417090961894,"c":1,"x":0.11125293234648809,"y":0.16044003964454545,"w":0.82698170979817709},{"y":0.17914118743037899,"h":0.020505348514684552,"w":0.83311330159505215,"c":1,"t":"about geo-engineering are the scientists involved in the research. Angel says that his plan is'no","x":0.11127689006721501},{"h":0.020549388892218023,"y":0.19715570315924369,"w":0.85168090820312503,"c":1,"x":0.11127790352908411,"t":"substitute for developing renewable energy: the only permanent solution'. And Dr Phil Rasch of"},{"x":0.11340205624217996,"y":0.21802325565516933,"w":0.82474227905273445,"h":0.018911565533121122,"t":"the US-based Pacific Northwest National Laboratory is equally guarded about the role of geo-","c":1},{"h":0.01889534914976565,"c":1,"x":0.11134021817279129,"t":"engineering: 'I think all of us agree that if we were to end geo-engineering on a given day, then","y":0.23546511593383812,"w":0.8329896545410157},{"x":0.11134020187877373,"w":0.84742268880208338,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"t":"the planet would return to its pre-engineered condition very rapidly, and probably within ten to","y":0.25572519094154211},{"t":"twenty years. That's certainly something to worry about.'","x":0.11134019590414965,"y":0.27180232541949367,"c":1,"h":0.018895349149765539,"w":0.50309280395507805},{"w":0.79999999999999993,"h":0.017441861012089666,"c":1,"t":"The US National Center for Atmospheric Research has already suggested that the proposal","x":0.10927835041800459,"y":0.30232558111947938},{"h":0.017464904874755716,"w":0.81649485270182298,"x":0.10927834675366276,"y":0.32119788609384803,"c":1,"t":"to inject sulphur into the atmosphere might affect rainfall patterns across the tropics and the"},{"c":1,"x":0.10927833940087396,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.33852025839149547,"t":"Southern Ocean. 'Geo-engineering plans to inject stratospheric aerosols or to seed clouds would","w":0.84948455810546875},{"y":0.35610465099102462,"w":0.8268040974934896,"c":1,"h":0.018895349149765539,"t":"act to cool the planet, and act to increase the extent of sea ice,' says Rasch. 'Bur all the models","x":0.10927836383226482},{"y":0.37345207300695127,"x":0.10702890065564427,"w":0.51385009765625,"h":0.023807505474885859,"t":"suggest some impact on the distribution of precipitation.'","c":1},{"h":0.021915263312043631,"x":0.10920260327119213,"y":0.40195519358768594,"t":"'A further risk with geo-engineering projects is that you can \"overshoot\", says Dr Dan","w":0.75684549967447912,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.79793813069661457,"t":"Lunt, from the University of Bristol's School of Geophysical Sciences, who has studied the","x":0.10927835723457691,"y":0.42296511600310549,"h":0.017441861012089777},{"t":"likely impacts of the sunshade and aerosol schemes on the climate. 'You may bring global","w":0.78762883504231762,"h":0.018903030063989856,"c":1,"x":0.10927837088090285,"y":0.44039929543749179},{"h":0.01949433837998138,"t":"temperatures back to pre-industrial levels, but the risk is that the poles will still be warmer than","y":0.45882531933162274,"w":0.8393036905924478,"c":1,"x":0.10920924390362236},{"x":0.10921083023576537,"t":"they should be and the tropics will be cooler than before industrialisation.' To avoid such a","y":0.47634590917533992,"w":0.80012868245442703,"h":0.019928784910819175,"c":1},{"y":0.49706400451130395,"c":1,"x":0.10927833947116436,"t":"scenario, Lunt says Angel's project would have to operate at half strength; all of which reinforces","h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.84948455810546886},{"x":0.10927835878949442,"h":0.017615971814445186,"c":1,"y":0.51585437469523832,"w":0.70515462239583337,"t":"his view that the best option is to avoid the need for geo-engineering altogether."},{"h":0.017615971814445186,"t":"The main reason why geo-engineering is supported by many in the scientific community is that","w":0.83917526245117191,"c":1,"y":0.544920728398125,"x":0.11134020372027095},{"t":"most researchers have little faith in the ability of politicians to agree - and then bring in - the","x":0.1091912772936585,"y":0.56089126981715209,"h":0.021996223149548744,"c":1,"w":0.82491729736328123},{"t":"necessary carbon cuts. Even leading conservation organisations see the value of investigating the","y":0.58099426843741553,"c":1,"x":0.10921316615905606,"w":0.84343322753906258,"h":0.02046852537413868},{"h":0.017442714447003627,"w":0.8391752624511718,"y":0.60029069739846141,"t":"potential of geo-engineering. According to Dr Martin Sommerkorn, climate change advisor for","x":0.10927834806386234,"c":1},{"t":"the World Wildlife Fund's International Arctic Programme, 'Human-induced climate change","y":0.61773255774706493,"x":0.10927836158114189,"h":0.018895349149765539,"c":1,"w":0.8206185404459635},{"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"has brought humanity to a position where we shouldn't exclude thinking thoroughly about this","x":0.10721648556394807,"y":0.63799177936724027,"w":0.84123713175455728,"c":1},{"w":0.23155278523763023,"c":1,"t":"topic and its possibilities?'","y":0.65396884951928858,"x":0.10900564044321072,"h":0.020226898014160444},{"x":0.05773195873857908,"y":0.95203488362767408,"w":0.028865979512532551,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"26"},{"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35218917374923969,"c":1,"h":0.022622550296839461,"y":0.95429983585653255,"w":0.29143658955891932}],"w":2400}